            <div xml:id="m-a16efa41-fe36-40a0-a2f8-a9bdc6232ccc">
              <lg xml:id="m-59bb2e0f-f936-4d24-ba98-dc6d7a6cb1d6">
                <l xml:id="m-05993323-d367-4983-b22c-9311a3b4817f" facs="#m-1ea0e3b6-efc8-43e9-9d59-40eebe2dabfc" label="ambiguous">1072</l><l xml:id="m-4d762f26-0480-43a6-9422-5a274ca74e15" facs="#m-a69f8a0b-e929-4159-ba92-3965f7469d70" label="text-like">22nd Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-aaba14d7-57fd-4229-90c8-c18f8455445a" facs="#m-e917b92e-eaf1-4504-a8e8-c0b221ca9c1d" label="lyrics-like">dit in bár¬</l><l xml:id="m-8eb29fdd-a57b-41d2-8d6d-abd909a9fc60" facs="#m-8909ff7b-384a-459c-b4bb-4c78a8f64c18" label="lyrics-like">quod descén¬</l><l xml:id="m-d59f057a-f394-46ed-9016-e91534486c90" facs="#m-920e0b7e-1ae7-4d96-a68d-c7a57fb22233" label="ambiguous">bam,</l><l xml:id="m-c6713cf4-a892-4a3d-8b37-bf9062f4a66f" facs="#m-3534a91e-e02f-4487-ac97-2a0019252158" label="lyrics-like">bár- bam “ A-a-ron.</l><l xml:id="m-a057236f-83db-4cce-a847-7dacae90167b" facs="#m-6780c599-f35f-4339-831f-93425b5d44f7" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-30041aa4-7717-4e75-bf1a-8320504ecdb6" facs="#m-cd9e24f1-9002-4862-89ac-46dac826d2f9" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-1f90aa6b-b149-4fe5-aa45-7646fa17a23c" facs="#m-b4fab67a-eb29-4da4-8acb-e7dc8d1867af" label="ambiguous">V. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-e53a1656-d956-433a-94da-22f423c9b6f4" facs="#m-f471a3b6-68ba-4143-a524-1dd825fa1058" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4a2c7a98-69c1-43c0-b2d8-7d0c1bb08e1c" facs="#m-4ed9e383-f2e8-4bd4-bc0c-4e07b15c6141" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-bd0343eb-29bf-4642-b1a2-2d8b7ee63f3a" facs="#m-2d3782a9-95ce-47aa-ae07-c1454122e2fe" label="lyrics-like">tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-e81fccc6-f440-4577-8ca7-cf5fe16f34cb" facs="#m-4a281334-928e-49bc-b7c0-b1307a426861" label="ambiguous">minum,</l><l xml:id="m-6b96252b-b953-4972-9b1b-9cc904dfef4a" facs="#m-43af55f4-09c7-40ca-b526-a4407967c9a6" label="lyrics-like">ment Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f04609f-6232-4e1e-9dac-c783e55eb87a" facs="#m-4bb76251-9d99-4936-a87c-ce2e97f73a2b" label="lyrics-like">in é¬</l><l xml:id="m-78346c7e-aba2-4268-a4a2-68a61aab9fde" facs="#m-180ae704-bbba-4c33-b984-4caf0445b323" label="lyrics-like">0: adjú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a56686e-3bcc-477c-8686-12aab42aa73c" facs="#m-3f6e3530-3c4c-47b0-9382-473a5637ab26" label="lyrics-like">spé¬ rent</l><l xml:id="m-daa59c22-48ed-4b0b-8daa-00f977029f37" facs="#m-c47d85f9-70bc-47a0-bdeb-78c0d8d4c1ef" label="ambiguous">tor et</l><l xml:id="m-30d39c6e-3f87-4e73-8149-3a0c0a1c8ad9" facs="#m-343ed486-767a-475f-b14e-b445ee028ca1" label="lyrics-like">pro¬ té¬</l><l xml:id="m-961f0d44-b2ad-4214-b117-9d2174f56acf" facs="#m-d684f250-4893-4f82-bb1f-889773c72b1e" label="ambiguous">ctor * e-6¬</l><l xml:id="m-c69949de-bc74-434a-afe5-34dbfdd7fda8" facs="#m-c6e9a65f-a5fc-4645-9e18-0489e9a40cb8" label="ambiguous">rum est.</l><l xml:id="m-2dd88112-8771-4bf5-b5e6-59263005cf0a" facs="#m-a1c0d390-ee48-45a0-97f1-a259741e6a0c" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum.</l><l xml:id="m-5b4e81a1-81c0-4afe-bca1-62e1d53c0b91" facs="#m-816cc7f4-5fb3-4216-bf59-c70477a0e976" label="ambiguous">Maith. 22. b.</l><l xml:id="m-aa1cb847-1c3c-4360-a5ce-e3fc553aa439" facs="#m-c94be1c7-76cd-473c-a7af-47d2ed0f2b0f" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Abeúntes Pha-] an non? Cógnita autem Jesus nequí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6aaa1c0e-1709-412a-8464-a46caec45970" facs="#m-73c46384-e5e5-4a74-b59e-9e54d3c4e364" label="lyrics-like">L risaéi consilium iniérunt. ut cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d356f33e-19b5-4678-8f4d-c539f0a5df96" facs="#m-2e3d581c-7edf-4520-8feb-4b347969a356" label="lyrics-like">tia eórum, ait : Quid me tentátis,</l><l xml:id="m-4c1b4176-c22e-4efe-bf3b-6e011034277f" facs="#m-bb072993-5003-423b-887b-fbd2d2fe9267" label="lyrics-like">perent Jesum in sermóne. Et mit¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c5fd10f-681a-49aa-aff0-cf28065060f7" facs="#m-be24ea1d-7326-4643-9a45-67ac53ae720d" label="lyrics-like">hypócritae? Osténdite mihi numí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c4e91c9-7ddd-4759-8a66-3370acf6070d" facs="#m-f6042275-fa25-49d4-84be-3874a6e76f00" label="ambiguous">tunt ei discipulos suos cum Hero¬</l><l xml:id="m-148a6381-5672-47f0-8c33-c4b3daabd95b" facs="#m-448a5ba0-dfbb-4e32-8d3b-9fe19719470e" label="lyrics-like">sma census. At illi obtulérunt ei</l><l xml:id="m-d2d45ffc-ca40-4dd9-9422-7a7e90b877b3" facs="#m-c55c8691-321d-4d0e-aa81-4067814b5af2" label="lyrics-like">diánis, dicéntes: Magíster, scimus</l><l xml:id="m-3e0d2fbe-b596-492f-ab35-237b503868bd" facs="#m-25fd3dc5-2f90-4ab0-ae80-291d944ee14d" label="lyrics-like">denárium. Et ait illis Jesus: Cuius</l><l xml:id="m-0448f212-a171-4144-8c84-ab5a424f3e32" facs="#m-c10ac499-df06-428c-b328-cdc5fbb25b69" label="ambiguous">quia verax es, et viam Dei in veri¬</l><l xml:id="m-4932f38f-7e08-4c41-860a-49db4f328b4d" facs="#m-5fa95f4f-5c1d-474d-9344-443b81df6e6d" label="lyrics-like">est imágo haec, et superscriptio?</l><l xml:id="m-106706be-d3ff-4a56-9527-471d3773f94f" facs="#m-72763e5e-6d23-4bcf-8d2b-91f1545e8fdf" label="lyrics-like">Dicunt ei: Caésaris. Tunc ait illis:</l><l xml:id="m-c6b1a9e6-8b99-414e-89a1-3a479256ae93" facs="#m-515b5aa2-91e2-42a4-a026-d53ca643c73f" label="lyrics-like">táte doces, et non est tibi cura de</l><l xml:id="m-fa5f3232-2bfc-4980-a412-bfb6c814b9ca" facs="#m-cab165bf-210c-4310-98fa-f7f48ae70b52" label="lyrics-like">Réddite ergo quae sunt Caésaris,</l><l xml:id="m-1fb107d0-660f-4e37-b235-4deb7ecbcbe7" facs="#m-5d37475b-8079-40ca-afa2-a06d64280cdb" label="lyrics-like">aliquo: non enim réspicis persónam</l><l xml:id="m-6d5d751d-679a-4720-ac17-8ef6de4917e8" facs="#m-cee99c46-8dd6-4f03-a8cc-ee612c54d8c5" label="lyrics-like">Caésari; et quae sunt Dei, Deo.</l><l xml:id="m-54c96bee-540e-4e27-8de5-c60eed8fe231" facs="#m-e3604132-4f73-4909-8c2a-c586cdb4312b" label="lyrics-like">hóminum: dic ergo nobis quid tibi</l><l xml:id="m-9bebbbab-1c88-471b-8c44-2cd88fecf560" facs="#m-f32066dd-0683-4ef6-9917-4b19c1dcc0ea" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-7d9bb0d2-bfb2-4ec7-8615-6f1cd6e9f3d0" facs="#m-2151e950-cfb9-4c48-b875-86a18298658e" label="lyrics-like">vidétur, licet censum dare Caésari,</l><l xml:id="m-2da162c0-cc5a-49dd-abf4-b83ec6f4eacf" facs="#m-58cc9714-2ba3-4a09-b099-5edd3346e817" label="ambiguous">orert.E</l><l xml:id="m-f1d798cb-13ba-4316-9443-1b06f419f57b" facs="#m-7ef63f0a-b091-4f5b-9258-da3fd6112bd4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-726a5927-b3bb-403b-8a31-a3d8e5d964f8" facs="#m-e2786b73-1151-4447-8bb8-e3f3a43de4f0" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-19a25577-afb0-4299-80cb-dda19773adcb" facs="#m-d66a0cfa-6e6a-4ffc-865c-33bf6895b944" label="lyrics-like">E-cordá-re mé-i," Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1e4b08e-3d1b-4c05-8ea7-15eee82d5e9d" facs="#m-6e9d906c-0a73-4a00-bf2b-50a3da76067b" label="lyrics-like">mi- ne, ómni pot-en¬</l></lg>
            </div>
